        <p class="role-line"><strong>Head of Platform</strong> &middot; Senior DevOps / Platform Engineer &middot; Solutions Architect &middot; AI &amp; Agentic Systems</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="lede">I build the paved roads other engineers ship on: internal platforms, reusable infrastructure, and delivery pipelines that make the safe path the fast one. Lately that includes the guardrails coding agents need before they go anywhere near a running system. This page collects the work behind that — the problems that were interesting enough to still think about, and what actually got built.</p>
